    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Once Ilana is rank 1 and has a physical body, she gains the following occult innate spells. As her rank increases, her occult spell DC and spell attack modifier increase, and she gains additional innate spells.\n\nOccult Innate Spells DC 22, attack +14; 3rd Locate, Soothe; 2nd Clear Mind, Everlight, Soothe; 1st Force Barrage, Mending, Soothe; Cantrips (3rd) Daze, Detect Magic, Light, Read Aura, Telekinetic Projectile\n\nRank 2 DC 24, attack +16; 4th Clear Mind; 3rd Hypercognition. Her cantrips are heightened to 4th rank.\n\nRank 3 DC 26, attack +18; 5th Dreaming Potential; 4th Soothe. Her cantrips are heightened to 5th rank."
